| 4. Deposit sync | `services/deposit/deposit.ts` gains `syncDeposits`; `/deposit` gains an explicit refresh button. Tap-only — it is an update call. The backend's `#err("No new deposits found")` is the ordinary answer and renders as a neutral note, not an error. |
| 7. Treasury display | `services/buy/buy.ts` gains `getUsernameTreasury`; `/username` renders it as a footnote under the total. |
